+                    <div style="min-height: 0; overflow: hidden;">
+                      <p class="_answer_7drst_100">AI proposal software uses artificial intelligence to automate and support the process of responding to requests for proposals (RFPs). These platforms can analyze RFP documents, extract requirements, generate structured draft responses, check compliance, and recommend relevant content from past proposals. The goal is to help teams produce higher-quality, compliant proposals faster while improving win probability through AI-driven proposal automation and workflow intelligence. Learn more in our guide: <a href="https://lotuspetal.ai/blog/2026/02/27/ai-proposal-software-the-complete-guide/">AI Proposal Software: The Complete Guide to AI-Powered Proposal Automation</a>.</p>
