+                  <div class="_answerWrapper_7drst_100">
+                    <div style="min-height: 0; overflow: hidden;">
+                      <p class="_answer_7drst_100">LotusPetal AI identifies federal, state, local, and commercial RFPs, including upcoming forecasts, recompetes, and competitive bids. The platform analyzes procurement signals and matches opportunities to your organization's capabilities, past performance, and strategic priorities to prioritize the most relevant pursuits. These insights support stronger <a href="https://lotuspetal.ai/capture/">AI-powered capture management and opportunity discovery</a>, helping teams focus on the bids they are most likely to win.</p>
