+                    </span>
+                  </button>
+                  <div class="_answerWrapper_7drst_100">
+                    <div style="min-height: 0; overflow: hidden;">
+                      <p class="_answer_7drst_100">Most RFP opportunity discovery tools match keywords and stop there, leaving your team to qualify, capture, and write everything else. LotusPetal AI covers the entire pursuit, not just discovery: it retrieves your organization's actual knowledge and past performance instead of storing static answers, incorporates your pursuit context automatically, and learns from every outcome, win or loss, so the next opportunity is easier to win than the last. Proposals are drafted by PetalOS, LotusPetal AI's engine trained on winning proposals, bid debriefs, and bid protests, grounded in your knowledge, not written from scratch. Learn more about the <a href="https://lotuspetal.ai/blog/2025/09/26/how-we-built-an-ai-engine/">AI engine that powers LotusPetal AI's opportunity intelligence and proposal automation capabilities</a>.</p>
+                    </div>
+                  </div>
+                </div>
