+                      <p class="_answer_7drst_100">Yes. LotusPetal AI automatically extracts requirements from RFP documents and generates structured compliance matrices. This allows proposal teams to track every requirement, ensure complete coverage, and reduce the risk of missing critical compliance elements as part of <a href="https://lotuspetal.ai/blog/2026/02/27/ai-proposal-software-the-complete-guide/#The-LotusPetal.AI-Structured-Proposal-Lifecycle">LotusPetal AI's structured proposal lifecycle for AI-powered proposal automation</a>.</p>
